\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Molecular docking simulation of small molecule with MEIOB (aa272-471) and SPATA22(aa236-363)}. \textbf  {a} Preferential binding mode between compounds and MEIOB according to docking simulation using Pymol software. The amino acid residues involved in interactions are labeled. \textbf  {c} Preferential binding mode between pyrogallol and MEIOB. \textbf  {d} Preferential binding mode between N-methyl-4-nitroaniline and MEIOB. \textbf  {e} Preferential binding mode between 2,6-Diethylaniline and MEIOB. \textbf  {f} Preferential binding mode between trimethydroquinone and MEIOB. Cyan: MEIOB; Green: SPATA22; Red: Candidate molecules.}}{15}{figure.caption.36}\protected@file@percent }
